<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-3562] Dependency to outdated Lucene 3.5.0</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-3562</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Ignite 1.6.0 comes with Lucene 3.5.0 core as dependency, which dates back to the year 2011.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This makes it difficult to integrate with newer software.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12992168">IGNITE-3562</key>
            <summary>Dependency to outdated Lucene 3.5.0</summary>
